      <div class="spec"><span class="eyebrow">Body · Atkinson Hyperlegible Next</span><div class="big" style="font-size:1.9rem;font-weight:700">Il1 O0 rn m</div><p>Designed by the Braille Institute for low-vision readers. One sentence in the pitch ("even our font was chosen for accessibility") helps with the design score.</p></div>
